   iNote "    Checking  GPIO3_2  with '1'"
   iNote "    Checking  GPIO3_1  with '0'"
   iNote "    Checking  GPIO3_0  with '1'"
   iNote "    Checking  GPIO2_7  with '0'"
   iNote "    Checking  GPIO2_6  with '1'"
   iNote "    Checking  GPIO2_5  with '0'"
